&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.65pt; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify;mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;Approval
of the details shown below (the Reserved Matters) shall be obtained from the
local planning authority in writing before any development is commenced:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
