none;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;Landscaping,
which shall include hard and soft landscape works including permeable paving. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:67.15pt;mso-add-space:auto;
